          "idea": "The simplest retriever counts how many meaningful words a question and a chunk share, and ranks by that count. It works only when the question happens to use the document's own vocabulary.",
          "example": "\"At what temperature does charging stop with a warning?\" shares words like charging, temperature and warning with the Warning and shutdown section, so that section ranks first.",
