          "takeaway": "Word overlap measures shared vocabulary, not shared meaning.",
          "notebook": "Ask \"What keeps running during a blackout?\" and watch every chunk score 0, including `solar_microgrid:load-priorities`, which actually holds the answer. Reword the question in the document's own terms and the same retriever puts it first.",
