          "notebook": "Three failures run one after another, a rejection, a destructive request with an authority claim, and an injection hidden in retrieved data, and each ends with an empty outbox and intact tasks. Then watch the run assert that total side effects is 0, and a second approval of the same action id send nothing more.",
